STEP 1 PROBE SOURCE, inline per global rail 12 (the probe was deleted, so quoted output alone would only be a lead). Recreate as `probe-criterion.test.ts` + `probe.vitest.config.ts` at the repo root and run `npx vitest run --config probe.vitest.config.ts`. Both are repo-root paths, so the root vitest include (`tests/**`, `packages/**`, `adapters/**`, `tools/**`) never picks them up.

probe.vitest.config.ts:
